      reactor uses declares that library explicitly, at compile scope, pinned to the very release the
      baseline used. The rule compiler's descriptor carries no dependency management section, and its
      parent is the rule engine aggregator of the same version;
    what actually governs the loaded version is the ROOT AGGREGATOR'S EXPLICIT MANAGED ENTRY for that
      library, present at runtime scope both at the base commit and at the migrated revision. That managed
