  and both of those fall after the test phase. An absent integration test is neither a pass nor a failure
  and may NEVER justify a test exclusion.
  Those five classes are precisely the ones that exercise the workflow engine end to end, and the module's
  most engine proximate unit test, the workflow engine data access test, is DORMANT at the baseline under
