  A second honest limit belongs to this report specifically. Because no run was executed, this file cannot
  and does not demonstrate that the decision table in section 9 compiled at the baseline. It records which
  test methods existed and nothing more. The evidence that the rule path behaves identically after the
  migration must come from the deployment and smoke gates, where creating an object that receives a
  generated number and moving a case through a queue transition exercise the decision tables for real.
  Because this module's source and POM are untouched and the rule engine's own version is constant, any
  difference between this report and its migrated counterpart points at the runtime itself or at a root
